{"lines": ["An Iranian pilot tried to fire a missile at a light over Tehran, and his weapons panel went dead.", "September nineteen seventy-six, after midnight. Four callers report a bright object. No helicopters are airborne.", "A fighter jet is scrambled. At twenty-five miles, it loses all instruments and radio. It turns away, and they return.", "A second jet gets a radar lock. The object keeps twenty-five miles ahead.", "But then another light leaves it and races at the jet. The pilot reaches to fire, and his weapons panel goes dead.", "A third light drops, settles gently, and lights the ground for miles. An airliner nearby loses radio too.", "At dawn, the crew finds only a beeping signal. Skeptics blame Jupiter and a faulty jet. The cable still reached the White House.", "Was it Jupiter and a faulty jet, or something that stopped a missile?"], "words": [["An", 0.0, 0.1], ["Iranian", 0.1, 0.34], ["pilot", 0.34, 0.92], ["tried", 0.92, 1.36], ["to", 1.36, 1.54], ["fire", 1.54, 1.86], ["a", 1.86, 2.06], ["missile", 2.06, 2.34], ["at", 2.34, 2.64], ["a", 2.64, 2.72], ["light", 2.72, 2.94], ["over", 2.94, 3.26], ["Tehran,", 3.26, 3.5], ["and", 4.26, 4.32], ["his", 4.32, 4.44], ["weapons", 4.44, 4.78], ["panel", 4.78, 5.3], ["went", 5.3, 5.52], ["dead.", 5.52, 5.9], ["September", 6.42, 6.74], ["nineteen", 6.74, 7.176], ["seventy-six,", 7.176, 7.72], ["after", 8.4, 8.68], ["midnight.", 8.68, 8.92], ["Four", 9.5, 9.8], ["callers", 9.8, 10.42], ["report", 10.42, 10.66], ["a", 10.66, 10.92], ["bright", 10.92, 11.12], ["object.", 11.12, 11.56], ["No", 12.04, 12.2], ["helicopters", 12.2, 12.58], ["are", 12.58, 13.22], ["airborne.", 13.22, 13.5], ["A", 14.22, 14.26], ["fighter", 14.26, 14.52], ["jet", 14.52, 14.86], ["is", 14.86, 15.14], ["scrambled.", 15.14, 15.4], ["At", 16.12, 16.16], ["twenty-five", 16.16, 16.5], ["miles,", 16.5, 17.1], ["it", 17.4, 17.48], ["loses", 17.48, 17.72], ["all", 17.72, 18.22], ["instruments", 18.22, 18.7], ["and", 18.7, 19.18], ["radio.", 19.18